      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Your profile says you are age verified (see the attached screenshot). https://vrchat.com/home/ageverification should also say \"Verification Complete\" for you.\n\nYou are probably experiencing the same user confusion detailed in another bug report: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/verify-emblem-missing\n\nIn case you can't toggle the \"Display Age Verification\" by editing your profile *in-client* to show Verified 18+ or you can't join Age Gated (18+ Verified) instances, you were age verified as a minor.\n\nThe website of this year does not currently display a checkmark on trust icons to indicate any age verification status (this is arguably a bug on the website).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
